- Client sends DHCPREQUEST for `10.50.20.150`.
- Server sends DHCPACK with the same options.
- Client completes DORA successfully; lease is active.

**Additional supplied context from the change ticket:**

- The scope currently has no explicit `option domain-name-servers` or `option domain-name`; the Grid default options apply.
- The reservation was added to the same scope as the range `10.50.20.100 – 10.50.20.200`.
